  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & O M=4, O A=2 \\\\ \\therefore & M A=\\sqrt{16-4}=\\sqrt{12}=2 \\sqrt{3} \\\\ \\therefore & \\text { Area }(M A O B) \\\\=& 2 \\times \\text { area } \\Delta M A O \\\\=& 2 \\times \\frac{1}{2} \\times M A \\times O A \\\\=& 2 \\sqrt{3} \\times 2=4 \\sqrt{3} \\text { sq. units } \\end{aligned}$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/mHbngJDPQA34-M3ZfLeYOZk_FSwYLa44yNd4f-ZX-do.original.fullsize.png\">",
